---
manual: check.block_or_query
lines: [2947, 2949]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $clicks = 0
  @with_block = check { $clicks += 1 }
  @plain = check
end
----------- test code
with_block = check("@with_block")
plain = check("@plain")
assert_equal 0, $clicks

with_block.trigger_click
assert_equal 1, $clicks, "a block attached to the check runs when it is clicked"

assert_equal false, plain.checked?
plain.trigger_click
assert_equal true, plain.checked?, "a check with no block can be asked later with checked?"
